        "effective_step": 9,
        "end_token_index": 554,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 555,
        "step_number": 10,
        "text": "9.  **Verification:**\n    Left Hand Side (LHS): $2^{60}$\n    Right Hand Side (RHS): $8^{20} = (2^3)^{20} = 2^{3 \\times 20} = 2^{60}$\n    LHS = RHS. The solution is correct."
      },
      {
