        "step_number": 12,
        "text": "11. **Drafting the Response:**\n    *   State the given equation.\n    *   Express 8 as a power of 2.\n    *   Apply power rules.\n    *   Equate exponents.\n    *   State the final result.\n    *   Add the specific closing line."
      },
      {
